<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- ==================================================
   DOCUMENT TYPE
   Purpose: Declares the document as HTML5 to ensure standardized rendering.
   Functionality: Instructs browsers to use HTML5 standards, enabling modern web features and consistent parsing.
   Client-Side Role: Ensures compatibility with modern browsers for proper page display.
   Logic: Uses DOCTYPE declaration to prevent quirks mode and enforce HTML5 rendering.
-->
<html>
<!-- ==================================================
   HTML ELEMENT
   Purpose: Serves as the root container for the base template, defining the document structure.
   Functionality: Provides a minimal structure for child templates to extend, with no language specified.
   Client-Side Role: Encapsulates all page content, including head, body, and template blocks.
   Logic: Lacks lang attribute; child templates inherit this structure for consistent layout.
-->
<head>
    <!-- ==================================================
       HEAD SECTION
       Purpose: Configures metadata, page title, and external resources for styling across all pages.
       Functionality: Defines character encoding, a dynamic title block, and links to CSS and fonts.
       Client-Side Role: Controls visual presentation and resource loading for all pages using this template.
       Logic: Uses a title block for extensibility and loads styles1.css, Unicons, and Montserrat font.
    -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>{% block title %}Student Course Hub{% endblock %}</title>
    <!-- Purpose: Sets a dynamic page title.
       Functionality: Allows child templates to override the default title "Student Course Hub".
       Client-Side Role: Displays a page-specific title in the browser tab.
       Logic: Uses a template block for flexibility in title customization.
    -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ base_path() }}/css/styles1.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unicons.iconscout.com/release/v2.1.6/css/unicons.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- ==================================================
       BODY SECTION
       Purpose: Contains the main content of the page, defined by child templates.
       Functionality: Provides a content block for child templates to insert page-specific content.
       Client-Side Role: Renders the core content area for all pages using this template.
       Logic: Uses a template block to allow dynamic content injection by child templates.
    -->
    {% block content %}{% endblock %}
    <!-- Purpose: Placeholder for page-specific content.
       Functionality: Allows child templates to define unique content for each page.
       Client-Side Role: Enables flexible content rendering for different pages.
       Logic: Uses a template block to support extensibility and modularity.
    -->
    <script src="{{ base_path() }}/js/main.js"></script>
    // ==================================================
    // SCRIPT SECTION
    // Purpose: Loads JavaScript for shared functionality across all pages.
    // Functionality: Includes main.js to enable common interactive features or initialization logic.
    // Client-Side Role: Enhances user interaction with shared JavaScript functionality.
    // Logic: Loads main.js using base_path() for dynamic routing; specific functionality depends on the script.
</body>
</html>